      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Close to the Bone is a film and album multimedia project releasing across 2022. The film just saw its first Newfoundland screening at the Nickel Film Festival in St. John’s and has won awards at both the Tagore and White Pearl International Film Festivals.    The 12 song album will release this fall"
      }
