        "@value": "Join us at The Garrick Annex with your host Jared Barnes for another night of friendly competition and lots of fun! Doors open at 7:30 PM Trivia starts at 8:15 PM As always, $10.00 per team - maximum 8 per team No reservations - first come, first served"
