      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Lost and alone, orphaned cub Mufasa meets a sympathetic lion named Taka, the heir to a royal bloodline. The chance meeting sets in motion an expansive journey of an extraordinary group of misfits searching for their destinies.    Trailer      Tickets"
      }
