      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Celtic Fiddlers are a vibrant group of 6 young professional musicians, ages 21-40. This unique group consists of fiddles, piano, mandolin, tin whistle, Irish flute, bodhran, cajone, accordion, banjo, bouzouki, bass, voice, guitar and drums. They have gained an outstanding reputation for their ec"
