      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Garrick Theatre presents our fourth Friday On Church event of the summer featuring three local favourites, Bob Little, Steven Abbott, and Jim Jones. Bring your family and friends along to enjoy some live, local music from all genres. It’s sure to be a great night.   $10 Cover Charge to be paid t"
