      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Relay 2024 Benefit Concert is happening again this year at the Garrick Theatre. Music Night is hosted by a local group who fund raise for the Daffodil Place, with all proceeds after costs going to the Daffodil Place.   There will be musical performances by various local artists/groups.    Ticket"
