    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Andrew Rodgers is a singer-songwriter based in St. John’s, Newfoundland. Andrew is also a founding member of the band, Fairgale who has shared the stage with musical luminaries including: Arkells, Lights, Melissa Etheridge, Blue Rodeo, Sloan. Fairgale has even performed with Trooper &amp; Bryan"
