      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Since the release of their first album in 2020, Rev Dave and the Sin Eaters has been nominated for two Music NL awards (Best Folk Group) and two ECMA awards (Best Country and Best Blues Recording). Drawing on traditional roots music the band's songs are contemporary, poetically vibrant, and rhythmic"
      }
