      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for a special performance by American operatic tenor, John Riesen, as he performs with pianist Andrea Lodge of Bonavista (via NYC), and the NSO's Atlantic String Quartet.&nbsp; These talented musicians will present an eclectic and enjoyable selection of music, ranging from classical and"
