    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Garrick Theatre presents our side door music series, Fridays On Church. Our first group of the 2024 season is Best Kind Trio. The band consists of 3 local residents of Bonavista, Sandra White, Harvey Mouland and Keith Elliott. The Trio brings together music of all genres and you will be in for a"
