        "@value": "CNA Winter Carnival - Movie Night - \"School of Rock\"   March 19, 7 PM  All are welcome! Admission is free!  Please consider supporting our Student Food Pantry Program. Bring non-perishable donations to help students in need.    Brought to you by CNA Alumni and Advancement office."
