      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Back for Season 3!   Trivia Thursday takes place every second Thurday at 8:30pm in the Annex. Doors open at 8pm.   $10 a team, 8 members max. Phones placed in sealed containers on your table. No reservations, first come, first served.   Wear a costume and get in the spirit for this special edition o"
