      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Our second Open Mic Night, hosted by Paul Ryan, will be taking place under our Friday’s on Church segment, in the Garrick Annex. Cover is $10 cash. Stop by, sing some tunes, listen to tunes or have a refreshing beverage!"
      }
    ],
