      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Monthly Karaoke Night.  Happening again in the Annex. Grab your friends or just yourself and head down to sing some songs, or listen to the others sing away the night.   $5 cash cover on the door. Doors open at 8pm. Karaoke runs from 9pm-12am."
