      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The true story of Mamie Till-Mobley's relentless pursuit of justice for her 14-year-old son, Emmett Till, who was brutally lynched in 1955 while visiting his cousins in Mississippi.     Tickets $10"
      }
    ],
