    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "CCMA-nominated artist, Mallory Johnson is turning heads in the country music scene with her recent Billboard-charting single (“Married”) and multiple award wins at the ECMAs and MusicNL Awards. The 2022 SiriusXM Top of the Country Semi-Finalist has received praise from the likes of CMT, The Bluegras"
