      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A Homecoming Collaboration …. only at the Garrick Annex!   Sherman Downey is a multiple award-winning artist whose unique brand of foot stomping folk has made him a fan favourite in Newfoundland, the mainland and beyond. Ana and Eric are a Brazilian duo based in St John’s, who offer a unique blend o"
