      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "An unforgettable evening of your favourite Newfoundland songs performed by your favourite Newfoundland artists.    Featuring: Kelly-Ann Evans, Vicki Harnett, Steve Maloney, Philip Goodridge, Alex Abbott, Julia Dunne, Melanie O’Brien, Courtney Brown with the Terra Bruce Band - Josh Ward, Paul Kinsman"
      }
