      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "They’re back!  Hot off the release of their third album    That Was You and Me   . This Juno-nominated, Indie-folk duo will blow you away with their disarmingly honest songs and sweet, sweet harmonies.   Check them out  .   Tickets $35"
