        "@value": "She’s MusicNL’s 2020 Country Artist of the Year.  A powerful performer with an infectious, fun-loving personality, and the courage to translate life’s most intimate moments into song. He’s country w/ occasional fuzz --- fuzz w/ occasional folk. Check them out   here   and   here  .    Tickets $30"
