      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Andrew Rodgers is a MusicNL award-winning and ECMA-nominated singer-songwriter based in St. John’s, Newfoundland. Known for his powerful voice and compelling storytelling, Andrew released his debut album, Let It Out, on July 26, 2024, earning three MusicNL nominations and an ECMA Nomination.  Beyond"
