        "@value": "Craig Young hails from the southwest coast of Newfoundland and Labrador.&nbsp; Craig’s guitar playing career has spanned decades and countries.&nbsp; From the age of three, Craig was enthralled with the guitar, as he watched his dad play heartfelt music while gripping the leg of the table. L"
