      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Two accomplished classical musicians trade black tie and high heels for the carefree stylings of  jigs and reels . Join Bonavista’s own  Andrea Lodge  as she blends uptempo  accordion  with exuberant storytelling while  Jay Sorce  complements beautifully on  guitar . A delight from start to finish,"
      }
