      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Desperate to rebuild her life with the daughter she's never known, Kenna finds unexpected compassion in a secret romance with local bar owner Ledger. As danger develops for both of them, Kenna hopes to find a second chance amid unbearable heartbreak.   Trailer"
