        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us in The Garrick Annex for an intimate night of music with Matthew Byrne.  Matthew Byrne is a Canadian folk singer and guitarist, who has performed and recorded both as a solo artist and as a member of The Dardanelles. Matthew has established himself as one of Canada’s foremost traditional sin"
