      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Get ready for a night filled with laughter, wit, and unforgettable memories as the Flat Out Tour makes its way to Garrick Theather Annex in Bonavista, Newfoundland! Join us on May 3rd for an evening where comedy reigns supreme, featuring the brilliant minds and talents of Nova Scotia-based co-headli"
      }
