      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Our first Friday On Church is happening on July 21st with Sherry Ryan and Maria Cherwick. Pop in to our Annex Lounge anywhere from 9pm-12am to take in the show and have a beverage.   Tickets can be purchased in advance by card for $15, or pay cash on the door and get your ticket for $10!    Advance"
      }
