      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "When Harry Met Sally is a cozy Autumn Rom-Com which begins when college graduates Harry Burns (Billy Crystal) and Sally Albright (Meg Ryan) share a contentious car ride from Chicago to New York, during which they argue about whether men and women can ever truly be strictly platonic friends. Ten year"
