      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Andrea Lodge grew up in Bonavista, and is a specialist in the performance of contemporary music, but hasn’t forgot about her roots. Andrea and Jay brighten up the theatre with their toe tapping traditional Newfoundland music night with an accordion, guitar, mandolin, banjo and bodhran!  The Kitchen"
      }
