      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Titanic -- you think you know the story, but think again. UNSINKABLE: Titanic Untold is the never-been-told story of the aftermath of the Titanic disaster. When the RMS Carpathia arrives in New York carrying survivors of the Titanic--passengers and crew alike--they find Senator William Alden Smith ("
