      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In order for Liza (Melissa D'Agostino, Six Days to Die, Tactical Girls) to cope with the impending death of her estranged mother Rosa (Wendie Malick, Shrinking, Hot in Cleveland, Just Shoot Me), she retreats to a 70's variety show in her mind. There the all-powerful host is her own mother, Rosa, who"
