    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Mallory Johnson is a 4x East Coast Music Award winner, CCMA nominated Artist and 2022 Semi-finalist for the prestigious SiriusXM Top of the Country competition. It’s no wonder that her recent debut album, Surprise Party soared to #2 on the iTunes country charts on its release in October and surpasse"
