        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The holiday season is starting, which means it’s time to break out those ugly seasonal sweaters! Dust them off and come out and enjoy a holiday sing along or see where the night takes you and sing whatever your heart desires!   $5 Cover on the door"
      }
